        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilation duct, PE corrugated tube, DN 75, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilation duct, PE corrugated tube, DN 75, at plant
Production of a typical component used for a ventilation system in a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h.;
UUID: e17bcaea-37c4-3b28-8fb0-f25194a77bd3
