Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e17bcaea-37c4-3b28-8fb0-f25194a77bd3.xml</text>
